  "description": "Beneath the Overworld, in the Underground Empire Jeojeojeo, the 17th Great King suddenly declares that they are leaving the throne. A contest is announced and the winner will get to be the new Great King. A Rank-A prisoner, the dethroned half prince named Jet, follows his father's command and participates in this contest but...\n\n\"What? To be the great king I have to protect that loser?!\"\n\nThat is the \"Token\". Jet needs to protect it in the fierce competition of the Underground people, where each person has to protect a \"Prince's Token\".\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/pozetssion/)",
